WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.397
This example makes the round trip idea visible.

00:00:03.397 --> 00:00:06.457
The first step creates a wide summary.

00:00:06.457 --> 00:00:11.282
The second step converts that wide summary back into long form.

00:00:11.282 --> 00:00:16.287
The result is long again, but it still contains summarized data.

00:00:16.287 --> 00:00:21.775
So a return to long form does not necessarily mean a return to the original detail.
